Third-party marks
-----------------
packages/engine/src/icon/brands.ts holds the Google, Microsoft and GitHub marks
for sign-in buttons, as those companies' branding guidelines describe for "sign
in with" buttons, and every renderer draws them from it: BrandMark in each web
foundation, PMBrandMark in platforms/ios and platforms/android. The marks are
trademarks of their respective owners. They are not licensed under the MIT
License and may be used only as those guidelines allow.

Fonts
-----
The house systems in design/systems/ name font families that applications
install from Fontsource: Bricolage Grotesque, Fira Code, Fraunces, Geist,
Geist Mono, Inter, JetBrains Mono, Lora, Outfit, Plus Jakarta Sans, Public Sans,
Source Sans 3, Source Serif 4 and Space Grotesk. No font files are distributed
with this repository or its packages; each font is licensed by its authors,
under the SIL Open Font License unless its package states otherwise.

Dependencies
------------
The published packages depend on, but do not bundle, third-party packages
(Radix UI, React Aria, Zag, lucide, d3, culori, apca-w3, zod and others),
each under its own licence as declared in its package.

